, "MATH_0019": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0020": "$S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{formal-defos-section-tangent-spaces}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{formal-defos-section-infinitesimal-automorphisms}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{formal-defos-lemma-tangent-space-vector-space}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-deformation-category}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{remark-deformation-category-implies}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{formal-defos-lemma-infaut-vector-space}", "REF_0007": "\\ref{stacks-morphisms-section-finite-type}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:98f5dacb1d0b42ccdf3b1481d279d41693d712adef43ab41ae6887e7b5530b83", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:aa1f0b81b423c16a908c4df0f5f385817f9c7b6a98d46594301ecebd5ba90b91", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:45c21161be106df3872e5663f45d9c55c6a5789e2c891828562407b04ea31940", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a locally Noetherian scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be a category\nfibred in groupoids over <MATH_0003>. Let <MATH_0004> be a field of finite\ntype over <MATH_0005> and let <MATH_0006> be an object of <MATH_0007> over <MATH_0008>.\nIn Formal Deformation Theory, Section <REF_0001>\nwe have defined the <TEXTITOPEN_0001>tangent space<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\n<MATHSEG_0001>isomorphism classes of morphisms<MATHSEG_0002> over <MATHSEG_0003>\nof the predeformation category <MATH_0009>.\nIn Formal Deformation Theory, Section\n<REF_0002>\nwe have defined\n<MATH_0010>\nwhere <MATH_0011> is the pullback of <MATH_0012> to <MATH_0013>.\nIf <MATH_0014> satisfies the Rim-Schlessinger condition (RS), then\n<MATH_0015> comes equipped with a natural\n<MATH_0016>-vector space structure by Formal Deformation Theory, Lemma\n<REF_0003>\n(assumptions hold by Lemma <REF_0004> and\nRemark <REF_0005>). Moreover,\nFormal Deformation Theory, Lemma <REF_0006>\nshows that <MATH_0017> has a\nnatural <MATH_0018>-vector space structure such that addition agrees with\ncomposition of automorphisms. A natural condition\nis to ask these vector spaces to have finite dimension.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nThe following lemma tells us this is true if\n<MATH_0019> is locally of finite type over <MATH_0020> (see\nMorphisms of Stacks, Section <REF_0007>).\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d63ca6bc9d78c08f38acb8ebf5855e1297d0fcfe965390d463cc9554ff9e7bf3", "unit_id": "tag:07WY:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "07WY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$U$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$(\\Sch/U)_{fppf} \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{F} = \\mathcal{F}_{\\mathcal{X}, k, x_0}$", "MATH_0007": "$T\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\text{Inf}(\\mathcal{F})$", "MATH_0009": "$k$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-predeformation-categories}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-dimension}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8789737be0fa63a89235d59caf27ec1896c5564bcfdd7338de801145713ea62a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:be5de0f72e105b49e44773f68adec54ca8c81e89093aae89a601ff28b4b8b25d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a locally Noetherian scheme. Assume\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002> is an algebraic stack,\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0003> is a scheme locally of finite type over <MATH_0004>, and\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0005> is a smooth surjective\nmorphism.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nThen, for any <MATH_0006> as in\nSection <REF_0001>\nthe tangent space <MATH_0007> and infinitesimal automorphism space\n<MATH_0008> have finite dimension over <MATH_0009>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7e6b06b023cf2deff0baab3f35440da64e7b31eac01bb5017cf71442060943a0", "unit_id": "tag:07X1:statement"}
